  "content": "<html><head></head><body><p><a href=\"https://laravel-news.com/unlearndev-goes-free-for-a-weekend-october-10-and-11\"></a></p>\n                                        <hr>\n\n                    <p>Unlearn is free on October 10 and 11. Bring your Laravel app and a ticket from your backlog, then spec, build and review it with AI. Grab your weekend pass.</p>\n\n                    <p>The post <a href=\"https://laravel-news.com/unlearndev-goes-free-for-a-weekend-october-10-and-11\">Unlearn.dev goes free for a weekend, October 10 and 11</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://laravel-news.com\">Laravel News</a>.</p>\n                    <p>Join the <a href=\"https://laravel-news.com/newsletter\">Laravel Newsletter</a> to get <a href=\"https://laravel-news.com\">Laravel</a> articles like this directly in your inbox.</p>\n\n                    </body></html>",
